# Copy-pasteable agent prompts for sibling repos (embarch-core, embarch-api) —
# useful locally, not meant for the public docs repo.
**/milestone-*-implementation-guide.md

# Fleet intake: one file per request, dropped by any thread, never committed.
# The supervisor converts these into tasks/ (which ARE committed) at phase 1.
inbox/*.md
!inbox/README.md

# Owner-local permission config: never commit, and never let a leg sweep it up
# with `git add -A` during a fold (embarch-fleet-risks.md).
.claude/settings.local.json

# Suite review pass reports, one per run (SUITE-REVIEW-PASS.md §6). Regenerable,
# so durability buys nothing and a stale findings file reads as current truth to
# whoever opens it next. Committed here rather than in `.git/info/exclude`, where
# the 2026-08-15 report's rule still lives: that file is local-only and
# unversioned, so a re-clone silently starts committing the reports instead.
.claude/suite-review-*.md
